 abstract  = "The article talks about the importance of shared decision making (SDM) in the National Health Service (NHS). It states that sharing decisions lead to mutual agreements and improves patient knowledge and self-esteem and reduces anxiety. Topics include SDM in dentistry, patient-clinician relationship, and patient-centered care. It is noted that SDM is also supported by the Great Britain's General Medical Council and General Dental Council.",
 author    = "Ryan, Fiona and Cunningham, Susan",
